        Opcode::ScopeHasBinding | Opcode::PropHas | Opcode::PropDelete | Opcode::ElemHas | Opcode::ElemDelete | Opcode::TryDefineLiveBinding
        | Opcode::TryReExportFields | Opcode::GetSuperBase | Opcode::Add | Opcode::Sub | Opcode::Mul | Opcode::Div | Opcode::Mod | Opcode::Pow
